    "levels_detector": {
        "_comment": "epic_071 / t910: S/R level + trendline detector params (src/data_handling/sync_tables/_levels_polars.py). Methodology: _doc_/methodology_doc/1700_features_sr_trendline.md. Research only until the t913 go/no-go.",
